flowchart TD
  A([New pay application]) --> B{Current budget<br/>revision with lines?}
  B -->|no| B1[Refused]
  B -->|yes| C[draft: edit lines,<br/>percent, deposit]
  C --> D[Mark ready:<br/>internal_review]
  D -->|return| C
  D --> E[Approve for billing:<br/>billed, owner_visible]
  E -->|undo if no later app<br/>and no invoice number| D
  E --> F[Owner sees it]
  E --> G[Accounting creates<br/>the invoice]
  G --> H[Staff record invoice<br/>number: synced]
  E -.read-only check.-> I[[Bridge reads accounting<br/>pay application snapshot]]
